"description": "Alerion Clean Power SpA engages in the production of electrical energy from renewable sources particularly in the wind power sector. It operates through the Operational Activities and Holding segments. The Operational Activities segment specializes in wind, solar, and biomass technologies. The Holding segment focuses on business consulting and real estate. The company was founded by Giuseppe Maria Paolo Garofano in 1995 and is headquartered in Milan, Italy.",
